msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "NCSF (Nitro Composer Sound Format) Audio Decoder"
msgstr "Dekodér zvuku NCSF (Nitro Composer Sound Format)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Adds decoding support for Nitro Composer Sound Format files (.NCSF/.MININCSF).[CR][CR]Nitro Composer Sound Format (NCSF) is a PSF-style for Nintendo DS music, specifically music that was created via Nitro Composer, a tracker-like composer that is part of Nintendo's Nitro SDK for the Nintendo DS."
msgstr "Přidává podporu dekódování souborů Nitro Composer Sound Format (.NCSF/.MININCSF).[CR][CR]Nitro Composer Sound Format (NCSF) je formát ve stylu PSF pro hudbu z Nintendo DS, konkrétně pro hudbu vytvořenou pomocí Nitro Composeru, trackerového kompozičního programu, který je součástí Nintendo Nitro SDK pro Nintendo DS."

# [Consistency] Make terms, settings names, brands and other minutiae, consistent throughout file.
